// Title: Uncommon Extension In Keyboard Layout IME File Registry Value
// Rule ID: b888e3f2-224d-4435-b00b-9dd66e9ea1f1
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.t1562.001
// Category: registry_set
